WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.469
-Hello! Hello!

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:06.071
Thank you and be quiet!

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:09.642
Now, listen up, 'cause
I'm only gonna yell this once!

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:13.580
Was tonight the landslide
we dreamed of? No.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:18.084
Was it the small victory
we expected? Also no.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.253
I'd like to congratulate
my opponent

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:24.056
and America's favorite
tickle monster, Joe Biden.

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:28.928
I'm sure he is handling his
victory with humility and grace.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.131
-Slap your ass and call
my lawyer. We did it!

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:35.635
Hey, man, no one thought I'd be
standing here on Super Thursday

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:38.404
in the great state of
what do ya call it.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:39.605
No one!

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.807
But check your
record player, Jack,

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.776
'cause Uncle Joey made it!

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:47.480
-Look, was I hoping
to celebrate tonight? Sure.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.549
I was ready to get lit!

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:53.219
[ Cheers and applause ]
I was ready to get slizzered!

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.956
I was ready to get Tik Tok'd
and do a "leep-urd."

00:00:56.956 --> 00:01:00.260
But instead,
Joe had a big night in the South

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.530
which luckily
has not gone to his head.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.864
-Yee-hoo!

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:08.534
I got Texas! I got Alabama!

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:11.671
I got the whole dang
Old Town Road!

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.874
In fact, I was there
when they wrote the damn song!

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:17.910
-I won California.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.013
I won Vermont.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.482
Well, I better have won Vermont.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.116
Last time I checked,
the state flag was

00:01:24.116 --> 00:01:27.654
me, Ben, and Jerry hotboxing
in a North Face tent.

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.956
Come on, people!

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:32.725
-Now I want to introduce you
to some folks.

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.260
This is my sister Valerie.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.861
-Sir, I'm a security guard.

00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:38.097
-Oh. And this is my wife, Jill.

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.266
-No, I'm --
I'm the same security guard.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.834
-Dagnabbit! They switched on me!

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:44.270
They s-- They switched on me.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.106
-Now -- Now let me be clear.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:49.642
It's still a tight race
between me and Joe,

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:52.945
so all I'll say is,
may the best man live.

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.947
-Uh, don't you mean
"may the best man win"?

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:58.017
-No, I do not. I do not.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.553
-And l-let me tell you
something about Bernie.

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:02.688
You know who's fired up
for Bernie? Russia!

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:04.390
They want him to win.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.393
You know who's fired up for me?
No one!

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.263
Hell, even I'm still on the
fence, and I am me, damn it!

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:12.298
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:16.302
-Listen to me. The coronavirus
has hit our shores.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.171
We need a leader who knows

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:20.573
a thing or two
about a health crisis.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:24.777
And look at me. Look at me.
I am a walking health crisis!

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:28.848
My Fitbit says, "Holy crap.
How is this guy still going?"

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.784
-And that's when I'll look
the coronavirus dead in the eye

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.053
and say,
"Back off, Buster Brown.

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:37.523
America's not open for business.
Not today, not ever!"

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:40.426
That right, Jimbo?
-Sir, who do you think I am?

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:43.696
-Luckily, it's not all bad
'cause earlier today

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:47.466
Mike Bloomberg dropped his
solid-gold ass out of the race.

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:49.068
Go home, Mike!

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.604
No one wants your money!

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:54.140
No one wants your money!

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.509
-Listen here, Mike.
I want your money.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:57.843
I want all of it.

00:02:57.843 --> 00:03:01.714
You can donate to me at
JoeBiden@skip-a-dee-doo-dah.net.

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.716
Thank you and thank you to the
great city of whatchamacallit.

00:03:04.716 --> 00:03:06.518
You've been confusing.

00:03:06.518 --> 00:03:09.188
-Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe!

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.190
-Hey, they're saying your name.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:16.095
-Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe!
Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe!

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:19.732 line:0%
Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe!
Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe!

